lass=\"full_label\">Add To Collection</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Collection</span></a></li><li class=\"community_link\"><a class=\"action_btn\" href=\"https://bonkyd.itch.io/island-of-mine/community\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" role=\"img\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"svgicon icon_comment\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\" /></svg>Community</a></li><li><a data-label=\"related_btn\" href=\"https://itch.io/games-like/1476043/island-of-mine\" class=\"action_btn related_games_btn\" target=\"_blank\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" role=\"img\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"svgicon icon_map\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_large family_noto-sans\"><div class=\"header align_left has_image\" id=\"header\"><img alt=\"Island Of Mine (beta)\" src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzIzMDUxMTMwLnBuZw==/original/EXERgL.png\"/><h1 class=\"game_title\" itemprop=\"name\">Island Of Mine (beta)</h1></div><div id=\"view_html_game_6013249\" class=\"view_html_game_page view_game_page page_widget base_widget ready\"><div id=\"html_embed_4065018\" class=\"html_embed_widget base_widget embed_wrapper\"><div style=\"width: 640px; height: 360px\" data-width=\"640\" data-height=\"360\" class=\"game_frame game_pending start_maximized\"><div class=\"restore_wrapper\"><button class=\"restore_btn button\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" role=\"img\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"svgicon icon_play\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polygon points=\"10 8 16 12 10 16 10 8\"></polygon></svg> Restore game</button></div><div class=\"iframe_placeholder\" data-iframe=\"&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://html-classic.itch.zone/html/13754644/index.html&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; scrolling=&quot;no&quot; allow=&quot;autoplay; fullscreen *; geolocation; microphone; camera; midi; monetization; xr-spatial-tracking; gamepad; gyroscope; accelerometer; xr; cross-origin-isolated; web-share&quot; id=&quot;game_drop&quot; webkitallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; mozallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; msallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; allowtransparency=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;\"><button class=\"button load_iframe_btn\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" role=\"img\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"svgicon icon_play\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polygon points=\"10 8 16 12 10 16 10 8\"></polygon></svg> Run game</button></div></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><p><a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/2658740/Island_Of_Mine/\" target=\"_blank\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzIxMzkwMzM4LnBuZw==/original/2d2aAZ.png\" alt=\"Wishlist\" title=\"Wishlist\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><span></span></p>\r\n<h1>Your Island Adventure Begins&nbsp;</h1>\r\n<p>Shipwrecked on a mysterious island, you must collect magical crystals to uncover new land and discover powerful stars that unlock new mechanics and resources. Build your village, craft equipment and battle dark creatures as you explore the island&#x27;s hidden secrets.<br></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzIxNDA3MTUyLmdpZg==/original/6Ei4Oa.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<h2>Explore a Mysterious Island</h2>\r\n<p>Use magic crystals to unlock new areas on the island. Each new area may contain useful resources, friendly NPCs, tricky puzzles or dangerous dungeons. You never know what surprises await you!\r\n</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzIxNDA3MTAzLmdpZg==/original/g4WJeb.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<h2>Build Your New Home\r\n</h2>\r\n<p>Find the perfect place to settle down. Gather resources, grow crops, and sell your goods at the market. Build a village and turn it into a place you can truly call home.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzIxNDA3MTgxLmdpZg==/original/AJ6Uae.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<h2>Enter the Unknown</h2>\r\n<p>Danger lurks beneath the surface! Explore ancient temples, mysterious caves and guarded barracks&mdash;each full of traps, puzzles and deadly enemies. Upgrade your gear and master new skills to overcome any threat in your way.</p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h2>A new version of Island of Mine is now available!</h2>\r\n<p>\r\n  This update brings a lot of new features and improvements &mdash; but please keep in mind it&#x27;s still in development, so some bugs might pop up. I&#x27;d really appreciate it if you report anything unusual you come across.\r\n</p>\r\n<p><strong>Here\u2019s what\u2019s new:</strong></p>\r\n<p>\ud83c\udf31 Farming \u2013 You can now plant and grow crops</p>\r\n<p>\ud83e\udea8 Relics replace Blessings \u2013 Earn them through special challenges for more world variety</p>\r\n<p>\ud83e\uddda\u200d\u2640\ufe0f Fairies \u2013 Now drop crystals as they escape</p>\r\n<p>\ud83d\uddff Ancient Construction Plans \u2013 Build special structures with unique effects</p>\r\n<p>\ud83d\udc14 Chickens \u2013 A new early-game food source</p>\r\n<p>\ud83c\udf33 New Skill Tree \u2013 More flexibility and a fresh design</p>\r\n<p>\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f NPC Mechanics \u2013 Meet characters who offer helpful services</p>\r\n<p>\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f Town Hall \u2013 Unlock useful upgrades</p>\r\n<p>\ud83d\udc87 Beauty Salon \u2013 Customize your character\u2019s appearance</p>\r\n<p>\ud83e\udde2 Cosmetic Items &amp; Unlockables \u2013 Discover visual customizations around the world</p>\r\n<p>\ud83d\udd27 Reworked Workbench \u2013 Improved info and usability</p>\r\n<p>\u2728 ...and lots more!</p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<h3>Join the community - let&#x27;s shape Island Of Mine together!</h3>\r\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://discord.com/invite/Kehrtakrcn\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzIxMzg5Nzc0LnBuZw==/original/%2FYHl%2BS.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><br></p>\r\n<h3>Don&#x27;t miss any updates. Follow us on social media!</h3>\r\n<h2><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://x.com/Island_Of_Mine\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img title=\"X\" alt=\"X\" src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzIxMzg5Nzk1LnBuZw==/original/6QPuS5.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/island_of_mine_game/\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img title=\"Instagram\" alt=\"Instagram\" style=\"color: inherit\" src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzIxMzg5ODA1LnBuZw==/original/afNrje.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.threads.com/@island_of_mine_game\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img title=\"Threads\" alt=\"Threads\" style=\"color: inherit\" src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzIxMzg5ODA4LnBuZw==/original/PnPX26.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/island-of-mine.bsky.social\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img title=\"Bluesky\" alt=\"Bluesky\" style=\"color: inherit\" src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzIxMzg5ODEyLnBuZw==/original/WBF6eJ.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><span></span><span></span></h2>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<pre>\r\nRecommended Specifications and Settings:\r\n\ud83c\udf10 Web Browser: Google Chrome\r\n\u2699\ufe0f Browser Hardware Acceleration: Enabled\r\n\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f Device: PC\r\n\ud83d\uddb1\ufe0f Input Device: Mouse\r\n\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f Display: Use Fullscreen Mode\r\n</pre></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a class=\"toggle_info_btn\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">More information<svg width=\"12\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" aria-hidden role=\"img\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" height=\"6\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div id=\"game_info_panel_1656949\" class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Status</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/in-development\">In development</a></td></tr><tr><td>Platforms</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/html5\">HTML5</a></td></tr><tr><td>Rating</td><td><div class=\"aggregate_rating\" data-tooltip=\"4.70 average rating from 185 total ratings\" tabindex=\"0\" itemprop=\"aggregateRating\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/AggregateRating\"><div itemprop=\"ratingValue\" class=\"star_value\" content=\"4.7\"><span class=\"screenreader_only\">Rated 4.7 out of 5 stars</span><div style=\"width: 93.94595%\" class=\"star_fill\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"star icon-star\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"star icon-star\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"tru